OL,3,GNEWSAE-scooter rider involved in crash
OL,4,Adies in hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 20s who was seriously
OL,7,Finjured in an e-scooter crash on
OL,8,FSaturday has died in hospital, police
OL,9,Fhave said.
OL,11,FEssex Police said emergency crews were
OL,12,Fcalled to the roundabout between Walton
OL,13,FRoad and Connaught Avenue in
OL,14,FFrinton-on-Sea at 20:00 BST, after a
OL,15,Fcollision between a privately-owned
OL,16,Fe-scooter and a car.
OL,18,FThe e-scooter rider suffered
OL,19,F"life-threatening injuries" and was
OL,20,Ftaken to hospital, according to the
OL,21,Fforce.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
